        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
          <div>
            <h3 id="how-does-poise-damage-differ-from-normal-damage" style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #c9a227; margin: 0 0 6px;">How does Poise Damage differ from normal damage?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Normal damage depletes the enemy health bar. Poise Damage depletes an invisible stability gauge above the enemy. When the poise gauge drops to 0, the enemy suffers Poise Break, resulting in a mandatory 1 to 2 turn Stun where they cannot take any action.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 id="can-high-tier-torment-bosses-be-stunned" style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #c9a227; margin: 0 0 6px;">Can high-tier Torment bosses be stunned?</h3>
